-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",205,{
[6529]="700523EA\n1\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"The Icy Crevasse\"\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"The Icy Crevasse\". NOTE: Do not retreat from combat.\n",
[6530]="70052515\n1\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"The Icy Crevasse (Tier 3)\"\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"The Icy Crevasse\".\n",
[6531]="700523E2\n1\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Thievery and Mischief\"\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Thievery and Mischief\". NOTE: Do not retreat from combat.\n",
[6532]="70052513\n1\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Thievery and Mischief (Tier 3)\"\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Thievery and Mischief\".\n",
[6533]="700523DF\n1\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Trouble in Tuckborough\"\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Trouble in Tuckborough\". NOTE: Do not retreat from combat.\n",
[6534]="7005251B\n1\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Trouble in Tuckborough (Tier 3)\"\tDefeat the Harbinger of the Dead in \"Trouble in Tuckborough\".\n",
[6535]="700460B2\n1\tRemove Draughts of Everworth (total: 6)\tAragorn has asked you to remove any of Galathir's Draught of Everworth infusions that have been left near patients in the House of Rest and the House of Remedies in the Houses of Healing.\n2\tBring Aragorn the Draughts of Everworth\tAragorn can be found in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should bring the harmful Draughts of Everworth to Aragorn, as he asked.\n",
[6536]="70041179\n1\tTalk to Gondren in Tarlang's Crown\tGondren can be found in central Tarlang's Crown. Harnion has asked you to rescue Gondren from the forces in Tarlang's Crown.\n",
[6537]="70028CA8\n1\tCollect supplies (total: 5)\tThe Dunlending transporting the supplies can be found along the hill east of Innoth's camp, reached by travelling the switchback to the north. Innoth has asked you to stop the Dunlendings from delivering their Orc-provided supplies to their various outposts.\n2\tTalk to Innoth near the Isen\tInnoth is at his camp, to the west and south of the Dunlending supply-line. You should return to Innoth with the supplies that you recovered from the Dunlendings.\n",
[6538]="7004E495\n1\tLeering Zhélruka can be found throughout Hammerstead. Concerned that ill-meaning glances shall soon turn to theft, Grámi Hornhelm has asked you to politely urge the visiting Zhélruka to depart Hammerstead.\t\n2\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tGrámi Hornhelm can be found at Hammerstead. Although not all of them took your words to heart, you have urged many of the visiting Zhélruka to depart Hammerstead. You should now speak to Grámi Hornhelm.\n",
[6539]="700687B1\n1\tTalk to Rimâti at the Shrine to He-Who-Sees-All\tRimâti has invited you to join her at the Shrine to He-Who-Sees-All. You can find the shrine at the southern end of the Tor-gardens.\n2\tHang banners on flag-poles (total: 3)\tRimâti has given you dyed banners to hang up at the Shrine to He-Who-Sees-All.\n3\tTalk to Rimâti\tYou have hung up the banners. You should talk to Rimâti.\n",
[6540]="70054CA8\n1\tComplete quests of Imlad Morgul: Continued Threats.\t\n2\tComplete quests of Imlad Morgul: Continued Threats (total: 8)\tComplete quests of Imlad Morgul: Continued Threats, weekly.\n",
[6541]="70054C9E\n1\tComplete quests of Imlad Morgul: The Reclamation.\t\n2\tComplete quests of Imlad Morgul: The Reclamation (total: 10)\tComplete quests of Imlad Morgul: The Reclamation, weekly.\n",
[6542]="70054CA4\n1\tComplete Imlad Morgul scaling instances.\t\n2\tComplete Imlad Morgul scaling instances (total: 4)\tComplete Imlad Morgul scaling instances, on any difficulty level, weekly. The scaling instance cluster can be found in the Instance Join panel.\n",
[6543]="7006C52E\n1\tAssist the quartermaster Nisami with her task\030Assist the tanner Ashkab with her task\tMalgat asked you to visit Ashkab and Nisami, the outpost's tanner and quartermaster, and help them with whatever was needed. They can be found in the outpost of Jirush.\n2\tInform Malgat of your assistance to Nisami and Ashkab\tYou aided both Ashkab and Nisami. With the work complete, you should return to Mallgat in Jirush near the northernmost standing arch and inform him of what you have done.\n",
[6544]="70025BFB\n1\tAssist Clark Standish again\030Assist Ballard Wilmer again\030Assist Rowena Parker again\030Assist Poppy Seaton again\tThere are several threats that must be addressed for Ost Forod to uphold its end of the pact.\n2\tTalk to Basil Gummidge at Ost Forod\tBasil Gummidge is at Ost Forod. Basil will be pleased to hear Ost Forod has upheld its end of the pact with Tinnudir.\n",
[6545]="70026E72\n1\tHelp Ondor collapse the cave\tHelp Ondor the Dwarf collapse the entrance to the Orc-cave.\n2\tTalk to Ondor\tWith the cave entrance collapsed, you might have a few spare moments to speak with Ondor.\n",
[6546]="70030025\n1\tCollect heirloom tools\tCollect heirloom tools within Imping.\n2\tBring the tools to Ethelbryt\030Collect heirloom tools (total: 8)\tYou should collect the heirloom tools left behind in the lumber-yard and bring them to Ethelbryt.\n",
[6547]="70030023\n1\tDefeat enemies in Imping\tDefeat enemies within Imping.\n2\tDefeat invaders in Imping (total: 20)\tTo weaken the resolve of the invaders within Imping, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.\n3\tTalk to Ethelbryt\tYou should return to Ethelbryt and inform him of your deeds within Imping.\n",
[6548]="70030020\n1\tDefeat the leader of the enemies within Imping\tEthelbryt has asked you investigate the village and find a way to discourage the invaders from remaining there.\n2\tTalk to Ethelbryt\tyou should return to Ethelbryt and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[6549]="70002E9A\n1\tCollect Shataz's cruel bludgeon\030Collect brimstone-tinged spears (total: 5)\tShataz may be found on the outskirts of the land of the giants in the Misty Mountains. Tarkrîp goblins may be found among the Orc-camps of Malenhad in Angmar. Wáli asked you to bring him the cruel bludgeon of Shataz and brimstone-tinged Tarkrîp-spears.\n2\tBring first set of components to Wáli\tWáli is at the outpost of Noglond, south of Thorin's Hall and west of the dwarf-city of Gondamon, in Ered Luin. Wáli is waiting for you to return with the first set of components he needs.\n3\tCollect grisly bat-talons (total: 20)\030Collect mottled spider-mandibles (total: 15)\030Collect hooked Warg-claws (total: 5)\tSpiders, Wargs, and bats may be found in Angmar and other dangerous places. Wáli asked you to bring him grisly bat-talons, mottled spider-mandibles, and hooked Warg-claws.\n4\tBring second set of components to Wáli\030Collect grisly bat-talons (total: 20)\030Collect mottled spider-mandibles (total: 15)\030Collect hooked Warg-claws (total: 5)\tWáli is at the outpost of Noglond, south of Thorin's Hall and west of the dwarf-city of Gondamon, in Ered Luin. Wáli is waiting for you to return with the second set of components he needs.\n5\tCollect crimson Gorthorog-horn\030Collect Sigil of War\tBarashal may be found at Carn Dûm in Angmar. Gruglok is at Urugarth in Angmar. Wáli asked you to bring him a crimson Gorthorog-horn and a Sigil of War.\n6\tBring final set of components to Wáli\030Collect crimson Gorthorog-horn\030Collect Sigil of War\tWáli is at the outpost of Noglond, south of Thorin's Hall and west of the dwarf-city of Gondamon, in Ered Luin. Wáli is waiting for you to return with the final set of components he needs.\n",
[6550]="70002DB3\n1\tCollect notched Ongbúrz-swords (total: 5)\030Collect Tramug's hand-axe\tOngbúrz Orcs may be found in Fasach-falroid in Angmar. Tramug stalks the swamps of Malenhad in Angmar. Gwesgylliel asked you to bring her notched Ongbúrz-swords and Tramug's hand-axe.\n2\tBring the first set of components to Gwesgylliel\tGwesgylliel is at Lin Giliath in Meluinen, in the North Downs. Gwesgylliel is waiting for you to return with the first set of components she needs.\n3\tCollect splintered Warg-claws (total: 20)\030Collect barbed barghest-tails (total: 20)\tWargs may be found in Angmar and other dangerous places, such as Eregion and the Misty Mountains. Barghests may be found in Imlad Balchorth in Angmar. Gwesgylliel asked you to bring her splintered Warg-claws and barbed barghest-tails.\n4\tBring second set of components to Gwesgylliel\030Collect splintered Warg-claws (total: 20)\030Collect barbed barghest-tails (total: 20)\tGwesgylliel is at Lin Giliath in Meluinen, in the North Downs. Gwesgylliel is waiting for you to return with the second set of components she needs.\n5\tCollect a flawless scale of Lhugrien\030Collect a Sigil of War\tLhugrien and Gruglok may both be found at Urugarth in Angmar. Gwesgylliel asked you to bring her a flawless scale of Lhugrien and a Sigil of War.\n6\tBring final set of components to Gwesgylliel\030Collect a flawless scale of Lhugrien\030Collect a Sigil of War\tGwesgylliel is at Lin Giliath in Meluinen, in the North Downs. Gwesgylliel is waiting for you to return with the last set of components she needs.\n",
[6551]="70071616\n1\tCollect Thardúth implements (total: 10)\tThe Utûgi have brought mysterious gifts from the Thardúth into the city of Emax Dûl. You should collect Thardúth implements from the east side of Emax Dûl.\n2\tTalk to Sorkamâl the Forbearing\tYou have collected the mysterious Thardúth implements from Emax Dûl. You should return to Sorkamâl the Forbearing in Nashûbu.\n",
[6552]="70041398\n1\tCollect Shataz's cruel bludgeon\030Collect brimstone-tinged spears (total: 5)\tShataz may be found on the outskirts of the land of the giants in the Misty Mountains. Tarkrîp goblins may be found among the Orc-camps of Malenhad in Angmar. Sterkist asked you to bring him the cruel bludgeon of Shataz and brimstone-tinged Tarkrîp-spears.\n2\tBring the first set of components to Sterkist\tSterkist is at the Spire of Meeting, in Rivendell. You have collected the first set of components Sterkist says he needs for his friend to make you a fine weapon, and you should bring them to him.\n3\tCollect splintered Warg-claws (total: 15)\030Collect barbed barghest-tails (total: 20)\tWargs may be found in Angmar and other dangerous places, such as Eregion and the Misty Mountains. Barghests may be found in Imlad Balchorth in Angmar. Sterkist says he needs splintered Warg-claws and barbed barghest-tails for his friend.\n4\tBring the second set of components to Sterkist\tSterkist is at the Spire of Meeting, in Rivendell. You have collected the second set of components that Sterkist says he needs for his friend to make you a fine weapon.\n5\tFind the Crimson Gorthorog Horn and Sigil of War and bring them to Sterkist\tSterkist is at the Spire of Meeting, in Rivendell. You have collected the final set of components for Sterkist, and should bring them back to him in Rivendell.\n",
[6553]="70000FB0\n1\tCollect frosted Corcur-staves (total: 8)\030Collect Driftclaw's rending-tooth\tCorcur may be found near Helegrod in the Misty Mountains. Driftclaw may be found in the land of the giants in the Misty Mountains. Isdi has asked you to bring her frosted Corcur-staves and Driftclaw's rending-tooth.\n2\tBring first set of components to Isdi\tIsdi is at the ruins of Edhelion, near Thorin's Hall. Isdi is waiting for you to return with the first set of components.\n3\tCollect hateful worm-eyes (total: 20)\030Collect putrid fingernails (total: 10)\tWights may be found at Imlad Balchorth in Angmar. Worms can be found in Forochel, Eregion, and the Misty Mountains. Isdi has asked you to bring her hateful worm-eyes and putrid fingernails.\n4\tBring second set of components to Isdi\030Collect hateful worm-eyes (total: 20)\030Collect putrid fingernails (total: 10)\tIsdi is at the ruins of Edhelion, near Thorin's Hall. Isdi is waiting for you to return with the second set of components.\n5\tCollect Emblem of Ritual\030Collect Rune of Evil Presence\tMorthrâng is within Urugarth and Sálvakh can be found in Carn Dûm. Isdi has asked you to bring her an Emblem of Ritual and a Rune of Evil Presence.\n6\tBring last set of components to Isdi\030Collect Emblem of Ritual\030Collect Rune of Evil Presence\tIsdi is at the ruins of Edhelion, near Thorin's Hall. Isdi is waiting for you to return with the last set of components.\n",
[6554]="70064229\n1\tCollect Throghásh's cask of fire-oil\030Collect steel water-flasks (total: 12)\tAelindil has asked you to collect Throghásh's cask of fire-oil at Eitheldir and also a number of steel water-flasks carried by half-orcs and brigands in the Angle of Mitheithel.\n2\tDeliver the first set of materials to Aelindil in Tornhad\tAelindil can be found at Tornhad in the Angle of Mitheithel.\n3\tCollect venomous dread turtle beaks (total: 10)\030Collect corrosive droplets (total: 10)\tBloated brimstone-leeches may be found in Eastern Malenhad and Duvuinen in Angmar. Dread-turtles may be found in Malenhad in Angmar. Aelindil has asked you to bring him venomous dread turtle beaks and corrosive droplets.\n4\tDeliver the second set of materials to Aelindil in Tornhad\tAelindil can be found at Tornhad in the Angle of Mitheithel.\n5\tCollect the putrid slime of Helchgam\030Collect a bloodstained tally stick\tHelchgam can be found at Carn Dûm in Angmar. Dafrim, Gríshakrum, and Kughûrz can all be found in Urugarth in Angmar. Aelindil has asked you to bring him a bloodstained tally sick and the putrid slime of Helchgam.\n6\tDeliver the final set of materials to Aelindil in Tornhad\tAelindil can be found at Tornhad in the Angle of Mitheithel.\n",
[6555]="7000127B\n1\tCollect Narglup's blunted tooth\030Collect chipped rock-worm fangs (total: 12)\tNarglup roams Fasach-larran in Angmar. Rock-worms dwell in the Misty Mountains. Baillindiel asked you to bring her chipped rock-worm fangs and the blunted tooth of the Warg Narglup.\n2\tBring first set of components to Baillindiel\tBaillindiel is at the Elf-harbour of Celondim, in Ered Luin. Baillindiel is waiting for you to return with the first set of components.\n3\tCollect corrosive droplets (total: 5)\030Collect splintered Warg-claws (total: 15)\030Collect grisly bat-talons (total: 5)\tBrimstone-slugs can be found in Angmar. Wargs can be found in Angmar and Eregion. Bats can be found in Angmar and Moria. Baillindiel asked you to bring her corrosive droplets, splintered Warg-claws, and grisly bat-talons.\n4\tBring second set of components to Baillindiel\030Collect corrosive droplets (total: 5)\030Collect splintered Warg-claws (total: 15)\030Collect grisly bat-talons (total: 5)\tBaillindiel is at the Elf-harbour of Celondim, in Ered Luin. Baillindiel is waiting for you to return with the second set of components.\n5\tCollect Emblem of Ritual\030Collect Rune of Winged Dominance\tMorthrâng may be found in Urugarth. Mormoz and Azgoth dwell in Carn Dûm. Baillindiel asked you to return with an Emblem of Ritual and a Rune of Winged Dominance.\n6\tBring last set of components to Baillindiel\030Collect Emblem of Ritual\030Collect Rune of Winged Dominance\tBaillindiel is at the Elf-harbour of Celondim, in Ered Luin. Baillindiel is waiting for you to return with the last set of components.\n",
[6556]="7005869E\n1\tCollect toughened Huorn bark (total: 4)\030Collect Wildwood Orc knives (total: 16)\tHunward has asked you to find toughened Huorn bark and Wildwood Orc knives from creatures in the Wildwood.\n2\tDeliver the first batch of materials to Hunward at Trader's Wharf\tHunward is at Trader's Wharf in the Wildwood.\n3\tCollect clouded worm eyes (total: 20)\030Collect venomous dread turtle beaks (total: 5)\tWorms may be found in Forochel and Angmar. Dread-turtles may be found in Malenhad in Angmar. Hunward asked you to bring him clouded worm eyes and venomous dread turtle beaks.\n4\tDeliver the second batch of materials to Hunward at Trader's Wharf\tHunward is at Trader's Wharf in the Wildwood.\n5\tCollect crimson Gorthorog-horn\030Collect Sigil of War\tBarashal may be found at Carn Dûm in Angmar. Gruglok is at Urugarth in Angmar. Hunward asked you to bring him a crimson Gorthorog-horn and a Sigil of War.\n6\tDeliver the last batch of materials to Hunward at Trader's Wharf\tHunward is at Trader's Wharf in the Wildwood.\n",
[6557]="7000130B\n1\tCollect nasty Snowreap-knives (total: 8)\030Collect Fakhthal's jagged blade\tSnowreap goblins can be found in the Misty Mountains. Fakhthal leads the Orcs of Fasach-falroid in Angmar. Dawn Stockard asked you to bring her nasty Snowreap-knives and Fakhthal's jagged blade.\n2\tBring first set of components to Dawn Stockard\tDawn Stockard is in the town of Archet, north of Bree. Dawn Stockard is waiting for you to return with the first set of components she needs.\n3\tCollect coiled spider-spinnerets (total: 15)\030Collect hateful worm-eyes (total: 15)\030Collect rotted barghest-paws (total: 5)\tSpiders can be found in Angmar and Helegrod in the Misty Mountains. Worms can be found in places like Forochel, the Misty Mountains, Sarnur in Ered Luin, and Eregion. Barghests can be found at Fornost in the North Downs, the Tomb of Maenadar in the Barrow-downs of Bree-land, and in Angmar. Dawn Stockard asked you to bring her coiled spider-spinnerets, hateful worm-eyes, and rotted barghest-paws.\n4\tBring second set of components to Dawn Stockard\030Collect coiled spider-spinnerets (total: 15)\030Collect hateful worm-eyes (total: 15)\030Collect rotted barghest-paws (total: 5)\tDawn Stockard is in the town of Archet, north of Bree. Dawn Stockard is waiting for you to return with the second set of components.\n5\tCollect teeth of a Gorthorog\030Collect Medallion of Passage\tThe Gertheryg Dushkâl, Brízrip, and Thordragh may be found at Urugarth in Angmar. Uruks may be found at Carn Dûm in Angmar. Dawn Stockard asked you to return with teeth of the Gorthorog and a Medallion of Passage.\n6\tBring last set of components to Dawn Stockard\030Collect teeth of a Gorthorog\030Collect Medallion of Passage\tDawn Stockard is in the town of Archet, north of Bree. Dawn Stockard is waiting for you to return with the last set of components she needs for the weapon she will make for you.\n",
[6558]="70000036\n1\tCollect Driftclaw's razor-sharp claw\030Collect corroded Iron Crown staves (total: 5)\tMen of Angmar may be found in Fasach-falroid and near Malenhad in Angmar. Driftclaw may be found in the Misty Mountains, where the giants dwell. Fenton Marshley asked you to bring him one of Driftclaw's razor-sharp claws and the corroded Iron Crown staves carried by the evil Men of Angmar.\n2\tBring the first set of components to Fenton Marshley\tFenton Marshley is at the Hunting Lodge east of Archet and north of Bree, in Bree-land. You have collected the first set of components Fenton Marshley has asked you to bring him.\n3\tCollect clouded worm-eyes (total: 20)\030Collect venomous dread-turtle beaks (total: 5)\030Collect putrid fingernails (total: 5)\tWorms may be found in Forochel and Angmar. Dread-turtles may be found in Malenhad in Angmar. Wights roam Imlad Balchorth in Angmar. Fenton asked you to bring him clouded worm-eyes, venomous dread-turtle beaks, and putrid fingernails.\n4\tBring the second set of components to Fenton Marshley\tFenton Marshley is at the Hunting Lodge east of Archet and north of Bree, in Bree-land. You have collected the second set of components Fenton Marshley asked you to bring him.\n5\tCollect Medallion of Passage\030Collect putrid slime of Helchgam\tUruks guard the city of Carn Dûm in Angmar, while the vile Helchgam dwells beneath. Fenton asked you to bring him a Medallion of Passage and the putrid slime of Helchgam.\n6\tBring the last set of components to Fenton Marshley\030Collect Medallion of Passage\030Collect putrid slime of Helchgam\tFenton Marshley is at the Hunting Lodge east of Archet and north of Bree, in Bree-land. You have collected the last set of components Fenton Marshley asked you to bring him.\n",
[6559]="70000F27\n1\tCollect brimstone-leech fangs (total: 5)\030Collect Narglup's split claw\tBrimstone-leeches can be found around the eastern reaches of Malenhad in Angmar. Narglup can be found near Tór Gailvin in the western reaches of Angmar. Sterling Proudfoot asked you to return with hollow brimstone-leech fangs and the split claw of the Warg Narglup.\n2\tBring first set of components to Sterling Proudfoot\tSterling Proudfoot is in Buckland, west of Bree and east of the Brandywine River. Sterling Proudfoot is waiting for you to return with the first set of components.\n3\tCollect hateful worm-eyes (total: 20)\030Collect venomous dread-turtle beaks (total: 15)\tThe worms which have the necessary eyes dwell in places like Forochel, the Misty Mountains, and Eregion. The dread turtles dwell in Malenhad in the eastern reaches of Angmar. Sterling Proudfoot asked you to bring him hateful worm-eyes and venomous dread-turtle beaks.\n4\tBring second set of components to Sterling Proudfoot\030Collect hateful worm-eyes (total: 20)\030Collect venomous dread-turtle beaks (total: 15)\tSterling Proudfoot is in Buckland, west of Bree and east of the Brandywine River. Sterling Proudfoot is waiting for you to return with the second set of components.\n5\tCollect Warg-keeper's token\030Collect cruel talon of Azgoth\tThe Warg-keeper Athpukh can be found in Urugarth in Angmar. The morroval-queen Azgoth can be found in Carn Dûm in Angmar. Sterling Proudfoot asked you to bring him a Warg-keeper's token and a cruel talon of Azgoth.\n6\tBring last set of components to Sterling Proudfoot\030Collect Warg-keeper's token\030Collect cruel talon of Azgoth\tSterling Proudfoot is in Buckland, west of Bree and east of the Brandywine River. Sterling Proudfoot is waiting for you to return with the last set of components.\n",
[6560]="7001670C\n1\tHead beneath the Cross-roads of Ash bridge\tRegin can be found in the south-west corner of the Flaming Deeps, underneath and just south of the Cross-roads of Ash. You should find and speak with Regin by taking the stairs down from the Cross-roads of Ash.\n2\tTalk to Regin below the southern bridge out of the Cross-roads of Ash\tRegin can be found in the south-west corner of the Flaming Deeps, underneath and just south of the Cross-roads of Ash. You should find and speak with Regin.\n3\tTalk to Gúthi at the Cross-roads of Ash\tGúthi is at the Cross-roads of Ash, in the western Flaming Deeps. You should return to Gúthi.\n",
})
